# Stray duplicate of the whole project that Windows' "Extract All" can create when a
# delivered zip is extracted directly into this folder (it defaults to a subfolder
# named after the zip, i.e. "jfy-alterations") — this has broken the production build
# twice by shadowing real files with a stale nested copy. Extract zips to a SEPARATE
# temp folder and copy only the changed files in, never directly into this folder.
/jfy-alterations/
